  "title": "capture: Check for valid wtap when capture.show_info",
  "description": "Changing profile during capture may change the capture_opts->show_info\nsetting. Always init cap_session->wtap and check if valid before doing\ncapture_info_new_packets().\n\nThis will not bring up the Capture Information dialog when switching\nto a profile having this enabled.\n\nFixes #17622",
